  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic Growth Program Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USDA provides support to the Economic Growth (EG) section of the USAID Ghana Mission for program management and technical services under a Participating Agency Service Agreement (PASA). This activity provides additional support to the management unit of the USAID/Ghana Mission under the Initiative to End Hunger in Africa (IEHA), as well as other services to support the mission&apos;s EG office in the performance of its functions relating to program design, monitoring and evaluation, and as needed, technical services for policy, regulatory reform, and training for increased agricultural growth and food security in Ghana.</narrative>
  </description>
